From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cloud-comms-engine <engine@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 14:39:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] repackage: applicationId com.mattermost.rnbeta ->
 com.diegonmarcos.comms.chat
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Give the Cloud-Comms chat fork its OWN install package id (constellation
identity; no collision with a real Mattermost). ONLY applicationId changes.
namespace stays com.mattermost.rnbeta (R/BuildConfig + native refs) — and the
com.google.gms.google-services plugin matches google-services.json against the
NAMESPACE, not applicationId, so google-services.json is left untouched (its
beta client already matches com.mattermost.rnbeta). Push stays disabled
(self-compiled apps need their own push service), so the Firebase project in
google-services.json being upstream's is irrelevant.
---
 android/app/build.gradle | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/android/app/build.gradle b/android/app/build.gradle
index 5568b9d7f..a471d031f 100644
--- a/android/app/build.gradle
+++ b/android/app/build.gradle
@@ -112,7 +112,7 @@ android {
     }
 
     defaultConfig {
-        applicationId "com.mattermost.rnbeta"
+        applicationId "com.diegonmarcos.comms.chat"
         minSdkVersion rootProject.ext.minSdkVersion
         targetSdkVersion rootProject.ext.targetSdkVersion
         versionCode 749
